window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/qpu-v25-054-f4fa4bb9c4d0f129.json"]={sha256:"f4fa4bb9c4d0f1295ff57296223250f8d2f96155362bad7115f464d046d28f70",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v25-case-ff15b0b67f0cb15d","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7","title":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","titleEn":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","publisher":"PsiQuantum team / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-054","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"qpu-v25-054","related":[{"id":"qpu-v25-055","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7"],"title":"光子 QPU 偵測鏈：偶然符合與時間窗","titleEn":"Photonic QPU detection: accidental coincidences and timing windows","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：以未扣背景和扣背景兩欄報告，不將相同可見度視為相同損耗。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Report raw and background-subtracted columns; equal visibility does not imply equal loss. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"估算獨立計數流的偶然符合，辨認時間窗定義。","differenceEn":"Estimate accidental coincidences in independent streams and make the window convention explicit.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。遠離重疊時符合計數1000，零延遲時100，曝光相同且此題不扣背景。 V=1−C零/C遠。 代入 1-100/1000，得到 0.9 dimensionless。V=(C遠−C零)/C遠；需相同曝光與穩定背景，且可見度不是完整閘保真度。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。兩偵測器單計數率各100000/s，總時間窗2 ns。 R偶然=10⁵×10⁵×2×10⁻⁹。 代入 1e5*1e5*2e-9，得到 20 events/s。低佔用且獨立卜瓦松計數時R偶然=R₁R₂W；W是總窗寬，非半窗。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Far-delay coincidences1000, zero-delay coincidences100, equal exposure, no background subtraction here. V=1−Czero/Cfar. Substituting 1-100/1000 gives 0.9 dimensionless. V=(Cfar−Czero)/Cfar requires equal exposure and stable background; visibility is not full gate fidelity. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Each detector records100000/s; the full coincidence window is2 ns. Racc=10^5×10^5×2×10^-9. Substituting 1e5*1e5*2e-9 gives 20 events/s. For low-occupancy independent Poisson streams Racc=R1R2W; W is full width, not half width. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"qpu-v25-064","referenceUrls":["https://www.nature.com/articles/s41534-025-01016-x"],"title":"矽量子點谷能階：熱佔據與初始化上限","titleEn":"Silicon valley states: thermal occupation and initialization limits","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：以未扣背景和扣背景兩欄報告，不將相同可見度視為相同損耗。 另一位學徒須能從輸入與算式重算，而非僅讀結論。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: Report raw and background-subtracted columns; equal visibility does not imply equal loss. A second learner must be able to reconstruct the result from inputs and equations.","difference":"估算額外激發能階的熱佔據，分開晶格溫度與電子有效溫度。","differenceEn":"Estimate thermal occupation of an extra excited level while separating lattice and effective electron temperature.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。遠離重疊時符合計數1000，零延遲時100，曝光相同且此題不扣背景。 V=1−C零/C遠。 代入 1-100/1000，得到 0.9 dimensionless。V=(C遠−C零)/C遠；需相同曝光與穩定背景，且可見度不是完整閘保真度。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","以下情境參數為合成教學輸入，並非案例設備實測或廠商規格；光速、波茲曼常數等標準物理常數另依名稱與單位標明。教學能隙Δ=100μeV、k=86.17μeV/K、電子溫度0.1K。 P激發=1/[1+exp(100/(86.17×0.1))]。 代入 1/(1+exp(100/(86.17*0.1)))，得到 9.12059e-06 dimensionless。兩個非簡併能階在熱平衡下P激發=1/[1+exp(Δ/kT)]；多谷、多自旋與非平衡需擴充配分函數。 將式子拆成至少兩個中間欄，逐欄保留單位。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Far-delay coincidences1000, zero-delay coincidences100, equal exposure, no background subtraction here. V=1−Czero/Cfar. Substituting 1-100/1000 gives 0.9 dimensionless. V=(Cfar−Czero)/Cfar requires equal exposure and stable background; visibility is not full gate fidelity. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Scenario parameters below are synthetic teaching inputs, not measurements or specifications of the named device; standard physical constants such as the speed of light and Boltzmann constant are identified separately by name and unit. Teaching gapΔ=100μeV, k=86.17μeV/K and electron temperature0.1K. Pexc=1/[1+exp(100/(86.17×0.1))]. Substituting 1/(1+exp(100/(86.17*0.1))) gives 9.12059e-06 dimensionless. For two nondegenerate levels at equilibrium Pexc=1/[1+exp(Δ/kT)]; extra valleys, spins and nonequilibrium require a larger partition function. Split the expression into at least two intermediate columns and retain their units.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v25-case-ff15b0b67f0cb15d","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41586-025-08820-7","title":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","titleEn":"A manufacturable platform for photonic quantum computing","publisher":"PsiQuantum team / Nature","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v25-case-8d23d6f09bd0c184","url":"https://www.nature.com/articles/s41534-025-01016-x","title":"Industrial 300 mm wafer processed spin qubits in natural silicon/silicon-germanium","titleEn":"Industrial 300 mm wafer processed spin qubits in natural silicon/silicon-germanium","publisher":"Primary research / npj Quantum Information","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
